omes a function of demand, in the long run price is demand: P=D\n\nStock-to-Flow model predicts price with S2F ratio: P=f(S2F)\n\nSo S2F model predicts demand\n#VeblenGoods\nhttps://t.co/l1amitPfpL https://t.co/mKLaXlu8HF","date":"April 30, 2021","dateISO":"2021-04-30T09:52:26.000Z","datetime":"2021-04-30 09:52","tags":["VeblenGoods","tweet"],"image":null,"imageAlt":"Tweet Image","__typename":"SocialMediaPost","provider":"Twitter","thirdPartyId":"1388060337782640642","url":"https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/statuses/1388060337782640642","originalUrl":null,"imageRemote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E0NhhXBWUAQzLb7.jpg","video":null,"channel":null,"channelUrl":null,"author":"PlanB","authorUrl":"https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD","authorImageRemote":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1381894517708754948/EpK8VJPe.jpg","authorImage":null,"authorSlug":"100trillionUSD","score":2450,"views":null,"sharedCount":320,"likeCount":1810,"sharedContent":null,"parent":{"localize":[{"locale":"ja","full_text":"価格は、需要と供給の関数である。P=f(S, D)\n\n供給が固定されると、価格は需要の関数となり、長期的には価格は需要となる。P=D\n\nStock-to-Flowモデルは、S2F比率で価格を予測する。P=f(S2F)\n\nつまり、S2Fモデルは需要を予測する\n#ヴェブレン製品\nhttps://t.co/l1amitPfpL https://t.co/mKLaXlu8HF","quoted_status_full_text":null,"retweeted_status_full_text":null},{"locale":"zh","full_text":"价格是供应和需求的一个函数。P=f(S, D)\n\n当供给固定时，价格成为需求的函数，在长期内价格就是需求。P=D\n\n库存-流量模型用S2F比率预测价格。P=f(S2F)\n\n所以S2F模型预测了需求\n#VeblenGoods\nhttps://t.co/l1amitPfpL https://t.co/mKLaXlu8HF","quoted_status_full_text":null,"retweeted_status_full_text":null},{"locale":"zh-Hant","full_text":"價格是供應和需求的一個函數。P=f(S, D)\n\n當供給固定時，價格成爲需求的函數，在長期內價格就是需求。P=D\n\n庫存-流量模型用S2F比率預測價格。P=f(S2F)\n\n所以S2F模型預測了需求\n#VeblenGoods\nhttps://t.co/l1amitPfpL https://t.co/mKLaXlu8HF","quoted_status_full_text":null,"retweeted_status_full_text":null}]}}]}},"pageContext":{"basePath":"/","pageType":"tag","tag":"VeblenGoods","tagsFilter":{"date":{"gt":"2000-12-25T10:54:58.000Z"}},"filter":{"date":{"gt":"2000-12-25T10:54:58.000Z"},"tags":{"eq":"Ve